AaveDust security integration
  ├── when an Aave V3 epoch deposit cannot mint a scaled unit
  │   ├── it should buffer the deposit without entering recovery
  │   ├── it should include the buffer once in Child TVL
  │   └── it should supply the aggregate and clear the buffer on the next deposit
  └── when an Aave V4 epoch deposit cannot mint an added share
      ├── it should buffer the deposit without entering recovery
      ├── it should include the buffer once in Child TVL
      └── it should supply the aggregate and clear the buffer on the next deposit
